<Description language="ENGLISH">"Ironbreaker"</Description>
<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"The Ironbreakers are a uniquely Dwarfen class of warriors, specialising in underground combat. Some Humans call them ‘Tunnel Fighters’, and they take no exception to this name, but ‘Tronbreaker’ is a more literal translation of the Khazalid Angthragor. Ironbreaker is a Warrior Career. If Careers are being determined randomly, then any Dwarf Character who rolls Guard or Soldier on the Random Class and Career Table (WFRP, pages 30-31) may choose to become an Ironbreaker instead."</Explanation>
